      If computers are your main pull, the diploma puts you against BCA and B.Tech holders for the same junior roles. A student with strong Maths may do better with Class 11 and 12 PCM and then a computing degree, or with a skill-first route and visible projects. Choose the diploma for computers only if you will build proof every month.
    </p>
  </div>

